                                  "content_truncated":  false,
                                  "content":  "Pager usage is off.\r\n============================================================\r\n11-E.32-CLEANUP\r\nCLEANUP AFTER REAL DEADLOCK\r\n============================================================\r\n\r\n=== 01. BEFORE CLEANUP ===\r\n fixture_run_count | fixture_stage_count | fixture_run_event_count | fixture_stage_event_count \r\n-------------------+---------------------+-------------------------+---------------------------\r\n                 1 |                   1 |                       0 |                         1\r\n(1 row)\r\n\r\n\r\n=== 02. CURRENT FIXTURE STATE ===\r\n      run_id       | run_status | current_stage | run_error_code |     stage_id      | stage_status | attempt | retryable | stage_error_code \r\n-------------------+------------+---------------+----------------+-------------------+--------------+---------+-----------+------------------\r\n RUN-11E32-FIXTURE | CREATED    | RUN_MANAGER   |                | STG-11E32-FIXTURE | ERROR        |       1 | t         | NETWORK_ERROR\r\n(1 row)\r\n\r\n\r\n=== 03. DELETE EVENTS ===\r\nDELETE 1\r\nDELETE 0\r\n\r\n=== 04. DELETE STAGE ===\r\nDELETE 1\r\n\r\n=== 05. DELETE RUN ===\r\nDELETE 1\r\n\r\n=== 06. AFTER CLEANUP ===\r\n fixture_run_count | fixture_stage_count | fixture_run_event_count | fixture_stage_event_count \r\n-------------------+---------------------+-------------------------+---------------------------\r\n                 0 |                   0 |                       0 |                         0\r\n(1 row)\r\n\r\n\r\n============================================================\r\n11-E.32-CLEANUP END\r\n============================================================\r\n",
