                                  "content":  "Pager usage is off.\r\nBEGIN\r\n============================================================\r\n11-E.32-FIX\r\nLOCK ORDER: RUN -\u003e STAGE\r\n============================================================\r\n\r\n=== 01. BASELINE FUNCTION COUNT ===\r\n fail_stage_function_count \r\n---------------------------\r\n                         1\r\n(1 row)\r\n\r\n\r\n=== 02. REPLACE fail_stage_atomically ===\r\nCREATE FUNCTION\r\n\r\n=== 03. FUNCTION EXISTS ===\r\n installed_function_count \r\n--------------------------\r\n                        1\r\n(1 row)\r\n\r\n\r\n=== 04. LOCK ORDER PROOF ===\r\n run_before_stage \r\n------------------\r\n FAIL\r\n(1 row)\r\n\r\n\r\n=== 05. REQUIRED SOURCE MARKERS ===\r\n classify_error | stage_error_event | running_guard | concurrent_guard \r\n----------------+-------------------+---------------+------------------\r\n PASS           | PASS              | PASS          | PASS\r\n(1 row)\r\n\r\n\r\n=== 06. CLEAN PRODUCTION ERROR STATE ===\r\n error_stages | retryable_error_stages | terminal_error_stages \r\n--------------+------------------------+-----------------------\r\n            0 |                      0 |                     0\r\n(1 row)\r\n\r\n error_runs \r\n------------\r\n          0\r\n(1 row)\r\n\r\n\r\n=== 07. FIXTURE CLEANLINESS ===\r\n fixture_runs \r\n--------------\r\n            0\r\n(1 row)\r\n\r\n fixture_stages \r\n----------------\r\n              0\r\n(1 row)\r\n\r\nCOMMIT\r\n\r\n============================================================\r\n11-E.32-FIX INSTALLATION COMMITTED\r\n============================================================\r\n",
