                                  "content":  "PSQL EXIT CODE: 0\r\n\r\nPager usage is off.\nOutput format is aligned.\n     section     |          proname          |                                               signature                                                \n-----------------+---------------------------+--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n FUNCTION_SOURCE | complete_stage_atomically | p_stage_id character varying, p_event_data jsonb\n FUNCTION_SOURCE | fail_stage_atomically     | p_stage_id character varying, p_error_code character varying, p_error_message text, p_event_data jsonb\n(2 rows)\n\n     section     |                                                        pg_get_functiondef                                                         \n-----------------+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n COMPLETE_SOURCE | CREATE OR REPLACE FUNCTION public.complete_stage_atomically(p_stage_id character varying, p_event_data jsonb DEFAULT \u0027{}\u0027::jsonb)+\n                 |  RETURNS TABLE(allowed boolean, error_code character varying, error_message text, resulting_status character varying)            +\n                 |  LANGUAGE plpgsql                                                                                                                +\n                 | AS $function$                                                                                                                    +\n                 | DECLARE                                                                                                                          +\n                 |     v_run_id VARCHAR(64);                                                                                                        +\n                 |     v_stage_status VARCHAR(32);                                                                                                  +\n                 |     v_artifact_id VARCHAR(128);                                                                                                  +\n                 |     v_artifact_status VARCHAR(32);                                                                                               +\n                 |     v_artifact_run_id VARCHAR(64);                                                                                               +\n                 | BEGIN                                                                                                                            +\n                 |                                                                                                                                  +\n                 |     SELECT                                                                                                                       +\n                 |         ps.run_id,                                                                                                               +\n                 |         ps.status,                                                                                                               +\n                 |         ps.output_artifact_ids -\u003e\u003e 0                                                                                             +\n                 |     INTO                                                                                                                         +\n                 |         v_run_id,                                                                                                                +\n                 |         v_stage_status,                                                                                                          +\n                 |         v_artifact_id                                                                                                            +\n                 |     FROM production_stage ps                                                                                                     +\n                 |     WHERE ps.stage_id = p_stage_id                                                                                               +\n                 |     FOR UPDATE;                                                                                                                  +\n                 |                                                                                                                                  +\n                 |     IF NOT FOUND THEN                                                                                                            +\n                 |         RETURN QUERY                                                                                                             +\n                 |         SELECT                                                                                                                   +\n                 |             FALSE,                                                                                                               +\n                 |             \u0027STAGE_NOT_FOUND\u0027::VARCHAR(128),                                                                                     +\n                 |             \u0027Stage inexistant.\u0027::TEXT,                                                                                           +\n                 |             NULL::VARCHAR(32);                                                                                                   +\n                 |         RETURN;                                                                                                                  +\n                 |     END IF;                                                                                                                      +\n                 |                                                                                                                                  +\n                 |     IF v_stage_status \u003c\u003e \u0027RUNNING\u0027 THEN                                                                                          +\n                 |         RETURN QUERY                                                                                                             +\n                 |         SELECT                                                                                                                   +\n                 |             FALSE,                                                                                                               +\n                 |             \u0027STAGE_NOT_RUNNING\u0027::VARCHAR(128),                                                                                   +\n                 |             (\u0027Stage dans l\u0027\u0027etat \u0027 || v_stage_status ||                                                                          +\n                 |              \u0027, RUNNING attendu.\u0027)::TEXT,                                                                                        +\n                 |             v_stage_status;                                                                                                      +\n                 |         RETURN;                                                                                                                  +\n                 |     END IF;                                                                                                                      +\n                 |                                                                                                                                  +\n                 |     IF v_artifact_id IS NULL OR v_artifact_id = \u0027\u0027 THEN                                                                          +\n                 |         RETURN QUERY                                                                                                             +\n                 |         SELECT                                                                                                                   +\n                 |             FALSE,                                                                                                               +\n                 |             \u0027OUTPUT_ARTIFACT_REQUIRED\u0027::VARCHAR(128),                                                                            +\n                 |             \u0027Aucun output artifact declare.\u0027::TEXT,                                                                              +\n                 |             v_stage_status;                                                                                                      +\n                 |         RETURN;                                                                                                                  +\n                 |     END IF;                                                                                                                      +\n                 |                                                                                                                                  +\n                 |     SELECT                                                                                                                       +\n                 |         ar.run_id,                                                                                                               +\n                 |         ar.status                                                                                                                +\n                 |     INTO                                                                                                                         +\n                 |         v_artifact_run_id,                                                                                                       +\n                 |         v_artifact_status                                                                                                        +\n                 |     FROM artifact_registry ar                                                                                                    +\n                 |     WHERE ar.artifact_id = v_artifact_id                                                                                         +\n                 |     FOR SHARE;                                                                                                                   +\n                 |                                                                                                                                  +\n                 |     IF NOT FOUND THEN                                                                                                            +\n                 |         RETURN QUERY                                                                                                             +\n                 |         SELECT                                                                                                                   +\n                 |             FALSE,                                                                                                               +\n                 |             \u0027OUTPUT_ARTIFACT_NOT_FOUND\u0027::VARCHAR(128),                                                                           +\n                 |             (\u0027Output artifact inexistant : \u0027 || v_artifact_id)::TEXT,                                                            +\n                 |             v_stage_status;                                                                                                      +\n                 |         RETURN;                                                                                                                  +\n                 |     END IF;                                                                                                                      +\n                 |                                                                                                                                  +\n                 |     IF v_artifact_run_id \u003c\u003e v_run_id THEN                                                                                        +\n                 |         RETURN QUERY                                                                                                             +\n                 |         SELECT                                                                                                                   +\n                 |             FALSE,                                                                                                               +\n                 |             \u0027OUTPUT_ARTIFACT_RUN_MISMATCH\u0027::VARCHAR(128),                                                                        +\n                 |             \u0027Output artifact appartenant a un autre run.\u0027::TEXT,                                                                 +\n                 |             v_stage_status;                                                                                                      +\n                 |         RETURN;                                                                                                                  +\n                 |     END IF;                                                                                                                      +\n                 |                                                                                                                                  +\n                 |     IF v_artifact_status \u003c\u003e \u0027VALIDATED\u0027 THEN                                                                                     +\n                 |         RETURN QUERY                                                                                                             +\n                 |         SELECT                                                                                                                   +\n                 |             FALSE,                                                                                                               +\n                 |             \u0027OUTPUT_ARTIFACT_NOT_VALIDATED\u0027::VARCHAR(128),                                                                       +\n                 |             (\u0027Output artifact dans le statut \u0027 ||                                                                                +\n                 |              v_artifact_status ||                                                                                                +\n                 |              \u0027, VALIDATED attendu.\u0027)::TEXT,                                                                                      +\n                 |             v_stage_status;                                                                                                      +\n                 |         RETURN;                                                                                                                  +\n                 |     END IF;                                                                                                                      +\n                 |                                                                                                                                  +\n                 |     UPDATE production_stage                                                                                                      +\n                 |     SET                                                                                                                          +\n                 |         status = \u0027SUCCEEDED\u0027,                                                                                                    +\n                 |         output_json =                                                                                                            +\n                 |             COALESCE(output_json, \u0027{}\u0027::jsonb)                                                                                   +\n                 |             || jsonb_build_object(                                                                                               +\n                 |                 \u0027completed_atomically\u0027,                                                                                          +\n                 |                 true,                                                                                                            +\n                 |                 \u0027completed_at\u0027,                                                                                                  +\n                 |                 NOW()                                                                                                            +\n                 |             ),                                                                                                                   +\n                 |         completed_at = NOW()                                                                                                     +\n                 |     WHERE stage_id = p_stage_id;                                                                                                 +\n                 |                                                                                                                                  +\n                 |     INSERT INTO production_stage_event (                                                                                         +\n                 |         stage_id,                                                                                                                +\n                 |         run_id,                                                                                                                  +\n                 |         event_type,                                                                                                              +\n                 |         from_status,                                                                                                             +\n                 |         to_status,                                                                                                               +\n                 |         stage_name,                                                                                                              +\n                 |         attempt,                                                                                                                 +\n                 |         event_data                                                                                                               +\n                 |     )                                                                                                                            +\n                 |     SELECT                                                                                                                       +\n                 |         ps.stage_id,                                                                                                             +\n                 |         ps.run_id,                                                                                                               +\n                 |         \u0027STATE_CHANGE\u0027,                                                                                                          +\n                 |         \u0027RUNNING\u0027,                                                                                                               +\n                 |         \u0027SUCCEEDED\u0027,                                                                                                             +\n                 |         ps.stage_name,                                                                                                           +\n                 |         ps.attempt,                                                                                                              +\n                 |         COALESCE(p_event_data, \u0027{}\u0027::jsonb)                                                                                      +\n                 |     FROM production_stage ps                                                                                                     +\n                 |     WHERE ps.stage_id = p_stage_id;                                                                                              +\n                 |                                                                                                                                  +\n                 |     RETURN QUERY                                                                                                                 +\n                 |     SELECT                                                                                                                       +\n                 |         TRUE,                                                                                                                    +\n                 |         NULL::VARCHAR(128),                                                                                                      +\n                 |         \u0027Stage complete atomiquement avec artifact valide.\u0027::TEXT,                                                               +\n                 |         \u0027SUCCEEDED\u0027::VARCHAR(32);                                                                                                +\n                 |                                                                                                                                  +\n                 | EXCEPTION                                                                                                                        +\n                 |     WHEN OTHERS THEN                                                                                                             +\n                 |         RAISE;                                                                                                                   +\n                 | END;                                                                                                                             +\n                 | $function$                                                                                                                       +\n                 | \n(1 row)\n\n      section      |                                                                                 pg_get_functiondef                                                                                  \n-------------------+-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n FAIL_STAGE_SOURCE | CREATE OR REPLACE FUNCTION public.fail_stage_atomically(p_stage_id character varying, p_error_code character varying, p_error_message text, p_event_data jsonb DEFAULT \u0027{}\u0027::jsonb)+\n                   |  RETURNS TABLE(allowed boolean, message text, stage_id character varying, stage_status character varying, attempt integer, retryable boolean, error_code character varying)        +\n                   |  LANGUAGE plpgsql                                                                                                                                                                  +\n                   | AS $function$                                                                                                                                                                      +\n                   | DECLARE                                                                                                                                                                            +\n                   |     v_run_id VARCHAR(64);                                                                                                                                                          +\n                   |     v_stage public.production_stage%ROWTYPE;                                                                                                                                       +\n                   |     v_classification RECORD;                                                                                                                                                       +\n                   |     v_event_data jsonb;                                                                                                                                                            +\n                   | BEGIN                                                                                                                                                                              +\n                   |                                                                                                                                                                                    +\n                   |     /*                                                                                                                                                                             +\n                   |      * ------------------------------------------------------------                                                                                                                +\n                   |      * 1. Resolve immutable stage -\u003e run relationship WITHOUT                                                                                                                      +\n                   |      *    taking the stage lock.                                                                                                                                                   +\n                   |      * ------------------------------------------------------------                                                                                                                +\n                   |      */                                                                                                                                                                            +\n                   |     SELECT ps.run_id                                                                                                                                                               +\n                   |     INTO v_run_id                                                                                                                                                                  +\n                   |     FROM public.production_stage ps                                                                                                                                                +\n                   |     WHERE ps.stage_id = p_stage_id;                                                                                                                                                +\n                   |                                                                                                                                                                                    +\n                   |     IF NOT FOUND THEN                                                                                                                                                              +\n                   |         RETURN QUERY                                                                                                                                                               +\n                   |         SELECT                                                                                                                                                                     +\n                   |             false,                                                                                                                                                                 +\n                   |             \u0027STAGE_NOT_FOUND\u0027::text,                                                                                                                                               +\n                   |             p_stage_id,                                                                                                                                                            +\n                   |             NULL::varchar,                                                                                                                                                         +\n                   |             NULL::integer,                                                                                                                                                         +\n                   |             NULL::boolean,                                                                                                                                                         +\n                   |             NULL::varchar;                                                                                                                                                         +\n                   |         RETURN;                                                                                                                                                                    +\n                   |     END IF;                                                                                                                                                                        +\n                   |    ",
